      "body": "The letter comes to {@bishop} first, on the letterhead of the Secretariat of State: the Pontifical Ecclesiastical Academy would like to receive a young priest of the diocese for its course, two years in Rome and a year of mission, and then the service of the Holy See abroad. {@bishop} writes in his note that he did not know Rome knew your name, and that he does now, and that men who go to the Academy do not, as a rule, come back to be pastors. It is the kind of letter that is not quite an order.",
